    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i understand but look, i've been reading about it online and people say bell's palsy is super common and usually clears up with rest or maybe some steroids. since i don't have the \"big\" stroke symptoms, it feels like such an overreaction to go to the hospital right now. if i just wait a day or two to see if it improves on its own, is that actually dangerous? i'd rather just monitor it at home for a bit first.",
